  "description": "In the city-state of Orihalconia, where alchemy and magic are deeply woven into everyday life, a reincarnated man named Paracelsus makes a modest living as an alchemist while concealing his powerful cheat skill.<br><br>\n\nOne day, however, he forms a contract with Nora, a sorceress slave girl, and encounters Coco, an elf who has been deprived of her limbs and all of her senses. From that moment, his life begins to change dramatically.<br><br>\n\nDetermined to save Coco, Paracelsus begins a small act of salvation from his humble workshop. But what starts as a personal mission soon grows into a conflict involving alchemy, sorcery, the cosmos, and even the gods themselves—<br><br>\n\nA story packed with \"everything fantasy has to offer\" is about to begin!<br><br>\n\n(Source: Official Website, translated)",
